[43.6506, "o", "\u001b[33m367a899\u001b[m fix(deploy): quote y and n again in converted manifests\r\n"]
[43.6507, "o", "\u001b[33m07a80bb\u001b[m refactor(deploy): drop single-letter tokens from _YAML11_AMBIGUOUS\r\n"]
[43.6507, "o", "\u001b[33mb92f938\u001b[m ci(demo): test the PR head with all deploy/utils unit tests\r\n"]
[43.6633, "o", "\r\n"]
[43.6633, "o", "367a899 fix(deploy): quote y and n again in converted manifests\r\n"]
[43.6633, "o", "\r\n"]
[43.6633, "o", "go-yaml, which kubectl and the API server use, reads y, Y, n and N as booleans (YAML 1.1). 07a80bb stopped quoting them, so an env value of \"y\" was applied as a bool, and test_dump_docs_quotes_yaml11_ambiguous_strings failed. Restore the tokens.\r\n"]
